  "target_content": "Last term, the student faced a new digital learning platform（平台）（平台）for the first time. She felt (1) anxious because she could not follow the online lessons at first. Her teacher told her that anyone could become (2) confident with daily practice. A classmate, who was always (3) curious about new apps, showed her how to use the search tool. The platform（平台） was not always (4) reliable, so the student learned to save her work often. If she were more (5) ambitious, she would try the extra tasks every week. Only by planning her time well could she (6) achieve real progress. Her teacher suggested that she (7) adapt her study habits to the online setting. Students were (8) encouraged to ask questions in the chat room. Last month, the student (9) persuaded her parents to let her study at home on rainy days. If she (10) concentrated for forty minutes, she took a short break. By (11) gradually building good habits, she improved her grades. Her teacher insisted that she (12) eventually set a clear goal for each week. With her teacher (13) independently checking her progress, she felt safe. Now she has (14) confidence in her ability, and every lesson is a new (15) opportunity to learn.",
